+ * copied vendor source, decompiled output, or an extracted binary payload.
+ * Delays retain the observed nanosecond argument passed to the common writer.
+ *
+ * This copy carries the bring-up, common, configuration and shutdown
+ * sequences for the generic PHY driver. The interrupt-clear sequence stays
+ * with the legacy camss CSIPHY path, which is the only one that services
+ * the PHY interrupt.
